<title>FRANCE: Skis Rossignol falls on results.</title>
<headline>Skis Rossignol falls on results.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in sports equipment maker Skis Rossignol fell on Monday after the company reported a fall in first-half profit and forecast lower full-year results, brokers said.</p>
<p>The shares were down 1.93 percent at 137.20 francs at 1035 GMT in a generally higher market.</p>
<p>Skis Rossignol reported a 14 percent drop in first-half profit to 129 million francs early on Monday and forecast lower results for the year ending on March 31.</p>
</text>
